notes.content:
We have launched a new update to fix some minor issues. The most relevant are:


    Some achievements could not be unlocked;
    Added a warning on the first use of the rewind button;
    The information panel had some missing texts;
    Changed intro and end scene to only close if the ESC button is pressed.

